      "llm_score": 2,
      "corrected_score": 2,
      "comment": "The agent correctly identified the main missing link: a_010 is connected to Patrick (I1) through pe_004 but has no corresponding link to Thomas (I2). It also correctly compared this with the 1850 assertion a_004, which has both links (pe_002 and pe_006). However, the agent incorrectly questioned pe_004's confident tier and recommended lowering it to probable, even though the existing tier is acceptable. The main finding was correct, but the confidence assessment was unnecessary and incorrect."
    },
